<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18794" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄχρονος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without time,
				instantaneous,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.448
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἄ. φύσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					404
				</span></i>
			; <i>short-lived,</i> of infants, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				125
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				5.18.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>independent of time,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				10.225
			</span></i>; <i>non-temporal,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. πᾶσα ἡ νόησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					4.4.1
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νως</span>”
				<i>timelessly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.Aphr.
					<u>in Mete.</u>
					129.5
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>in Sens.</u>
				135.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				124
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
				<u>in Phdr.</u>
				p.159
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>; <i>instantaneously,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.571
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				15.196b
			</span></i>.</div>
